      "title": "START HERE",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Decode a saved refined latent\nEvery *Open-H3 Regenerate* run saves its refined result to `output/open_h3_latents/` **before** decoding. If decoding failed (or you want the video again), this workflow turns a saved file into the final MP4 without redoing the refine.\n\n1. *Load Refined Latent* is set to **(newest)**: the most recently saved file. To decode an older one, pick it from the list (press **R** in ComfyUI to refresh the list).\n2. Press **Run**. Output: `output/video/open_h3_regen_2k_*.mp4` with the soundtrack stored in the file.\n\nTakes about a minute for a 15 s 2K clip (fast H3 VAE decoder, falling back to the regular decoder if the clip is too big for the GPU)."
      ],
      "color": "#2a2a2a",
      "bgcolor": "#353535"
    },
